        "original_id": "2f94dbe4-e8d4-5738-a5b3-6b5054921e96",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hyundai Stellar, Ford Cortina\n- Companies: Hyundai Motor Company\n- Places: Seoul, South Korea\n- Concepts: rear-wheel drive, mid-size automobile, licensed production\n\nFacts:\n- Hyundai Motor Company is a South Korean multinational automotive manufacturer headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.\n- Hyundai Motor Company built the Ford Cortina under licence before that model was due to be replaced.\n- The Hyundai Stellar was a mid-size rear-wheel-drive automobile produced by Hyundai Motor Company.\n- The Hyundai Stellar was produced to succeed the Ford Cortina that Hyundai Motor Company had been building under licence.",
